 "heading": "Smithsonian Institution",
 "paragraph": "The Smithsonian's open-access search covers every one of its museums. Its holdings from the biblical world turned out to be thin: a documented demo key allows about thirty calls an hour, and of the records it returned only a handful carry a date inside the period.",
